repository-code: https://github.com/elijahunderwood/single-point-of-failure-in-the-sky
abstract: >
  Data loggers, analysis scripts, interactive simulators and a live dashboard
  for a study of space weather as a common-mode threat to satellite navigation
  and satellite broadband. Measurements are from a u-blox ZED-F9P receiver in
  Belfast and from public space-weather and Global Navigation Satellite System
  (GNSS) archives.
